        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVDGR-ONE, Retro Fifth Avenue D Grip Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Fifth Avenue D Grip Entry Set features a deco themed handle that is a great addition to the historic buildings found all over the country. It gets its Fifth Avenue name tag thanks to its glamor and attention to style and detail. The Retro Fifth Avenue Handleset with D Grip is available in several beautiful finish colors with the interior knob or lever of your choice for a unique end look. This handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions and will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Thanks to its larger height of 19 inches, the Fifth Avenue One-Piece D Grip Entry Set is a great choice for big and tall doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur One Piece D Grip Fifth Avenue Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 5th Avenue D Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVDONE-specifications.pdf?v=1704262362\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue D-Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Retro Fifth Avenue Handleset with D Grip",
                "description": "The Retro Fifth Avenue D Grip Entry Set features a deco themed handle that is a great addition to the historic buildings found all over the country. It gets its Fifth Avenue name tag thanks to its glamor and attention to style and detail. The Retro Fifth Avenue Handleset with D Grip is available in several beautiful finish colors with the interior knob or lever of your choice for a unique end look. This handleset is available in single cylinder and dummy functions and will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Thanks to its larger height of 19 inches, the Fifth Avenue One-Piece D Grip Entry Set is a great choice for big and tall doors.",
                "keywords": "Grandeur One Piece D Grip Fifth Avenue Handlesets, 5th Avenue D Grip Handlesets, Retro Fifth Avenue Handleset with D Grips, Fifth Avenue One-Piece D Grip Entry Sets, GRA-FAVDGR-ONE, Grandeur FAVDGR-ONE, Grandeur Extra Large Fifth Avenue Handlesets, handlesets for large doors, Retro Fifth Avenue D Grip Entry Sets,"
